{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11206240","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11206240","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1120624001:1":{"text":"你们注意到了吗？切西格刚才说话时眼神飘忽不定。","source_cn":"你们注意到了吗？切西格刚才说话时眼神飘忽不定。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x792E254F962AD24D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120624002:1":{"text":"那不是刚苏醒过来的恍惚，更像是心虚。","source_cn":"那不是刚苏醒过来的恍惚，更像是心虚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE91256D697B7AF0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120624003:1":{"text":"什么，哪有？你一定是多心了！","source_cn":"什么，哪有？你一定是多心了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9E35D8B36E677FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120624004:1":{"text":"要是我刚刚从灾难中醒过来，眼睛也不会直瞧着同一个地方！准得四处打量打量才能安心！","source_cn":"要是我刚刚从灾难中醒过来，眼睛也不会直瞧着同一个地方！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC1D39700EB1ABB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120624005:1":{"text":"这叫做——有备无患！","source_cn":"这叫做——有备无患！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA250866AA05E69C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:11206